---
const username=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BUTTONDOWN_USERNAME;
---
<section class="newsletter dark-section" id="newsletter"><div class="container inner"><div><div class="eyebrow lime">THE SUNDAY ROUND</div><h2>BETTER GOLF.<br/><span class="lime">IN YOUR INBOX.</span></h2><p>One practical tip, one simple challenge, and zero swing-theory rabbit holes. Join the list.</p></div><div class="signup">{username ? <form action={`https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/${encodeURIComponent(username)}`} method="post" target="popupwindow" onsubmit="window.open('https://buttondown.com/' + this.dataset.username, 'popupwindow')" data-username={username}><label for="email">EMAIL ADDRESS</label><div class="form-row"><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required/><button class="btn" type="submit">SIGN ME UP ↗</button></div><input type="hidden" name="embed" value="1"/><p class="note">You'll receive newsletter emails. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></form> : <div><label for="email-disabled">EMAIL ADDRESS</label><div class="form-row"><input id="email-disabled" type="email" placeholder="Newsletter coming soon" disabled/><button class="btn" disabled title="Newsletter integration not configured">COMING SOON</button></div><p class="note">Newsletter signup will activate once the site owner connects Buttondown.</p></div>}</div></div></section>
<style>.newsletter{padding:80px 0}.inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.newsletter h2{margin:16px 0}.newsletter p{max-width:500px;color:#b5beb6;line-height:1.7}.signup{background:#232d26;padding:30px}.signup label{display:block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-bottom:12px}.signup .note{margin:13px 0 0;font-size:.74rem}.signup button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:800px){.inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.signup{padding:20px}}</style>
